ash.com/photo-1518895312237-a9e23508077d?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3wxMTc3M3wwfDF8c2VhcmNofDE5fHxnYW1ibGluZ3xlbnwwfHx8fDE3NjA1NjY0Mzh8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=2400","line":34,"embedded":true},{"title":"many have attempted to try","target":"https://www.bloomberg.com/features/2023-how-to-beat-roulette-gambler-figures-it-out/?ref=killscreen.com","line":42},{"title":"Play, Pay, Profit","target":"https://dl.digra.org/index.php/dl/article/view/2436/2429?ref=killscreen.com","line":58},{"title":"blue and red plastic toy car","target":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1597042962047-005b63a5eb25?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3wxMTc3M3wwfDF8c2VhcmNofDZ8fGNoaXBzJTIwcG9rZXJ8ZW58MHx8fHwxNzYwNTY2NzcyfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=2400","line":60,"embedded":true},{"title":"for the fourth year in a row","target":"https://www.8newsnow.com/news/local-news/nevada-casinos-beat-all-time-record-in-december-all-of-2024-las-vegas-strip-posts-2nd-highest-win-ever/?ref=killscreen.com","line":70},{"title":"pity timer","target":"https://esports.gg/guides/hearthstone/hearthstone-pity-timer/?ref=killscreen.com","line":76}],"metadata":{"title":"How Video Games Taught Everything Else to Gamble","source":"https://www.killscreen.com/gamblification-labubu-loot-boxes-gambling-mechanicsretry/","author":["[[Jamin Warren]]"],"published":"2025-10-15","created":"2026-05-15","description":"Blind boxes and gacha mechanics reveal how gaming's gambling playbook is reshaping retail, apps, and civic life through randomization and reward.","tags":["#clippings"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"7tjs11","at":1780884489374},"key":"Clippings/How Video Games Taught Everything Else to Gamble.md"},
